@GRPC_HostAddress = https://localhost:7130

GET {{GRPC_HostAddress}}/weatherforecast/
Accept: application/json

### Calls GRPC_B2B over gRPC (unary)
GET {{GRPC_HostAddress}}/B2BWeather?days=3
Accept: application/json

### Calls GRPC_B2B over gRPC (server streaming)
GET {{GRPC_HostAddress}}/B2BWeather/stream?days=3
Accept: application/json

### Validation error from GRPC_B2B -> expect 400
GET {{GRPC_HostAddress}}/B2BWeather?days=50
Accept: application/json

###
